525
00:42:03.460 --> 00:42:07.220
<v Ariel Dominguez>You think you got right, but reality doesn't work as well as you envisioned.

526
00:42:08.940 --> 00:42:13.240
<v Ariel Dominguez>about your product. Believe in your product. Like Irena said, don't throw the baby with the

