00:42:13.240 --> 00:42:19.140
<v Ariel Dominguez>bathwater, but be hypercritical about your own product. Because if you're your own worst critic

528
00:42:19.140 --> 00:42:24.760
<v Ariel Dominguez>in that way, then you're able to then be able to build and find the bugs and the opportunities for

