533
00:42:48.140 --> 00:42:52.020
<v Ariel Dominguez>Don't let the existing success just be the only thing you do.

534
00:42:52.160 --> 00:43:01.440
<v Ariel Dominguez>A lot of companies fail in that way where they hit gold really quickly and they think they have a winning product and then they don't iterate or they don't really change or adapt.

